sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Platform Controller
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant RCCtrl as RayCluster<br/>Reconciler
    participant AuthCtrl as Authentication<br/>Controller
    participant MTLSCtrl as mTLS<br/>Controller
    participant NPCtrl as NetworkPolicy<br/>Controller
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant OpenShift as OpenShift<br/>APIServer Config
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over User,Prometheus: CRD Reconciliation Flow
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply RayCluster CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-ray-io-v1-raycluster<br/>Admission (TLS)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-ray-io-v1-raycluster<br/>Admission (TLS)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Accepted
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR Created

    K8sAPI->>RCCtrl: Watch event: RayCluster created
    RCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Head Pod<br/>SA token auth
    RCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Worker Pods<br/>SA token auth
    RCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Services<br/>SA token auth
    RCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount<br/>SA token auth

    Note over AuthCtrl,OpenShift: Authentication Injection Flow
    K8sAPI->>AuthCtrl: Watch event: RayCluster created
    AuthCtrl->>OpenShift: Detect auth mode<br/>(OAuth vs OIDC)
    OpenShift-->>AuthCtrl: Cluster configuration
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Inject kube-rbac-proxy sidecar<br/>(:8443) into Head Pod
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>(Gateway API)
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ReferenceGrant

    Note over MTLSCtrl,CertMgr: mTLS Certificate Provisioning
    K8sAPI->>MTLSCtrl: Watch event: RayCluster created
    MTLSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create self-signed CA Issuer<br/>(cert-manager)
    MTLSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create CA Certificate<br/>(cert-manager)
    MTLSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create per-node Certificates
    CertMgr-->>K8sAPI: ray-head-secret (TLS)
    CertMgr-->>K8sAPI: ray-worker-secret (TLS)

    Note over NPCtrl: Network Policy Enforcement
    K8sAPI->>NPCtrl: Watch event: RayCluster created
    NPCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>for pod-level isolation

    Note over Prometheus: Metrics Collection
    Prometheus->>RCCtrl: GET /metrics<br/>:8080/TCP HTTP
    RCCtrl-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics

    Note over RCCtrl: Health Probes
    K8sAPI->>RCCtrl: GET /healthz :8082<br/>Liveness (unauthenticated)
    RCCtrl-->>K8sAPI: 200 OK
    K8sAPI->>RCCtrl: GET /readyz :8082<br/>Readiness (unauthenticated)
    RCCtrl-->>K8sAPI: 200 OK
